        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\operatorname{area}(\\triangle ABC)=\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta$.\n\nDrop a perpendicular from $B$ to $AC$ and add the areas of the two congruent right-angled triangles.",
          "worked": "Let $M$ be the foot of the perpendicular from $B$ to $AC$. The two right-angled triangles are congruent by RHS, so $\\angle ABM=\\angle MBC=\\theta$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}BM&=\\cos\\theta\\\\AM&=\\sin\\theta\\\\\\operatorname{area}(\\triangle ABC)&=2\\left(\\frac12\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\right)\\\\\\operatorname{area}(\\triangle ABC)&=\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
            {
              "id": "p22-q8-a-solution-diagram",
              "role": "solution",
              "format": "tikz",
              "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"source PDF page 22, question 8(a), authored split\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm,every node/.style={font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont,text=black}]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\coordinate (A) at (-1.5,0);\n\\coordinate (B) at (0,1.5);\n\\coordinate (C) at (1.5,0);\n\\coordinate (M) at (0,0);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.8pt] (A)--(B)--(C)--cycle;\n\\draw[black,dashed,line width=0.4pt] (B)--(M);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.4pt] ($(M)!2mm!(B)$)--($(M)!2mm!(B)+(M)!2mm!(C)-(M)$)--($(M)!2mm!(C)$);\n\\node[below left] at (A) {$A$};\n\\node[above] at (B) {$B$};\n\\node[below right] at (C) {$C$};\n\\node[below] at (M) {$M$};\n\\path (A)--(B) node[midway,above left] {$1$};\n\\path (B)--(C) node[midway,above right] {$1$};\n\\path (B)--(M) node[pos=0.74,right=2mm] {$\\cos\\theta$};\n\\path (A)--(M) node[midway,below] {$\\sin\\theta$};\n\\pic[draw=black,line width=0.4pt,angle radius=6mm,angle eccentricity=1.35,\"$\\theta$\"] {angle=A--B--M};\n\\pic[draw=black,line width=0.4pt,angle radius=6mm,angle eccentricity=1.35,\"$\\theta$\"] {angle=M--B--C};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
              "src": null,
              "widthMm": 70,
              "alt": "Mathematical diagram",
              "overlayOf": null,
              "transparent": false,
              "axes": null,
              "spec": {
